From 6d5e8788983556c411b87a1ddec5fcd4abab28bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:50:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: NFC quick setting and status icon

Plinius: two plugins for NFC through nfcd (org.sailfishos.nfc.Settings,
GetEnabled/SetEnabled/EnabledChanged):
- nfc-quick-setting switches NFC on and off; insensitive while nfcd
  does not run.
- nfc-status-icon shows an NFC symbol in the top bar while NFC is on.
nfcd lets only the group "privileged" switch NFC.
